WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:25.770
Now, everybody.

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:28.060
Starting with the betrayal
by Master Asia...

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.440
...the Death Army
makes its appearance.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:33.610
And passing on their crests
to Chibodee and the others...

00:01:33.610 --> 00:01:35.360
...the Shuffle Alliance sacrifice
their own lives.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:40.950
Looking back, we have witnessed
many surprises here in Shinjuku.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.450
And the battle here is
about to reach a climax.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:46.120
Also...

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:49.250
...will the Devil Gundam
make its appearance today?

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.420
And what about a battle
between Kyoji and Domon?

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:54.210
And now!

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:58.630
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:04.680
Ultimate Power and Evil!
Rise of the Devil Gundam

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.310
I'm against it!

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:12.310
You expect us to accept
those Fighters as our allies?

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:14.520
They were our enemies
just a moment ago.

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:17.860
But we need all the help
we can get.

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:18.950
Listen to yourself!

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:21.530
The people who got hurt
because of them...

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.950
You expect them to
go along with that?!

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:26.370
B-but you see...

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.840
Although my mind was taken over...

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.810
...how disgraceful for a knight
who should be protecting people.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.130
Now that this has happened...

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:43.470
...I am fully committed
to defeating Master Asia.

00:02:43.470 --> 00:02:47.020
It'll be our way to thank
the Shuffle Alliance...

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:52.480
...for sacrificing their lives
and passing their legacy on to us!

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:56.480
Until I accomplish this, I'll not
partake in the Gundam Fight.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:58.000
You know...

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:00.450
...I hate to say this after
everything that's happened to us...

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.450
...but I don't feel anything
special after getting this.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:07.950
I can't say I'm much interested
in the title "Queen of Spades."

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:10.410
But I'll have to pay back
that jerk...

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:12.170
...who used me like a puppet.

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:13.370
Listen.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:15.840
Just make sure none of you
get in my way.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.800
I won't think twice about
crushing anyone who tries to!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:23.130
I agree that an incompetent ally
is extremely hard to deal with.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.010
What are you trying to say?

00:03:25.010 --> 00:03:27.260
How about a little fight
right here and now?

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:28.220
Hold on.

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:30.700
This isn't the time for us
to be messing around.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.850
I know that, but...

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:37.400
...I've never experienced
this kind of frustration.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:40.360
And I'm sure that goes
for everyone here.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.480
Hey, Domon.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:46.570
Maybe you should be the one
to take charge right now.

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.280
We'll have a better chance
against Master...

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.540
No.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.210
I don't consider Master my enemy.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:53.170
That's right.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.580
The only enemies I must defeat...

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.290
...are the Devil Gundam and Kyoji.

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.840
And that's got nothing
to do with the others.

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.090
Domon...

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.050
An earthquake?

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:09.260
It's a big one!

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:19.400
Wh-what's going on?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.940
It's not subsiding.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.650
This tremor isn't normal.

00:04:26.950 --> 00:04:27.990
Rain!

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.170
A little longer...

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.800
Just a little longer before
we're able to leave.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.010
Yes.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:48.510
When that time comes,
it's goodbye to Shinjuku.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.360
Ow...!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:06.950
This isn't good.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.780
I must have fallen quite a bit.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:13.540
It also looks like I've been
separated from the others.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.540
I've got to look for a way
out of here.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.630
Ouch!

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.090
Ch-Chibodee?

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:28.380
Hey!

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:30.800
Taking a stroll in a place like this?!

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:36.230
A young lady should know better
than to walk alone.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:37.690
How about it?

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:40.060
How about if I
escort you out of here?

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:41.940
You mean you actually...?

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:44.570
Do you know the way out of here?

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:48.740
If that were the case,
I'd be very grateful.

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:57.160
Luckily, no one's been injured.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:59.890
We've been separated from...

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:01.530
...Domon Kasshu and the others.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.670
Are you still trembling from that?

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:09.380
No. It's not what you think.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:11.510
It's just that I
remembered something.

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:14.140
What exactly are you
talking about?

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:17.230
I saw something when
I was caught by Master Asia.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.270
Yes.

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:19.810
I remember now.

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:22.690
There was a huge Gundam
buried underground.

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:25.230
It was as if it were sleeping.

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:28.110
You all must've seen it.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.200
I'm sure of it!

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:33.200
I'll bet it's watching us from
the last place we'd expect.

00:06:33.570 --> 00:06:34.530
That's right.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:36.910
The earthquake and
the Death Army...

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:40.370
That horrible Gundam
must've been behind it.

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.380
And any time now...

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.840
...something even more awful
is going to happen.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.500
Any time now!

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:52.950
Another earthquake.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:54.700
What is going on?

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:04.690
Rats!

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.190
It looks like they're running away.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:15.120
Animals instinctively abandon
a place when they sense danger.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.580
Then...

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:17.450
...that means...!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.830
Wh-what's the matter, Bro?
What's going on?

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.420
Hurry, Sai Saici!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.000
We've got to find the others
and get out of here!

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:29.210
How're we going to...?!
Hey, wait up!

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:34.110
Monsieur, I can't help but notice...

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:37.720
...that the route you've chosen
is leading us further downward.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:39.640
Keep your trap shut.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.520
If you have a problem with it,
then go off on your own.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:45.940
If I left Mademoiselle Rain
alone with a beast like you...

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.730
...I'd be violating my
oath as a knight.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:49.900
What's that mean?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:50.940
You suggest a duel?

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:53.400
C-come on, do you have
to do this now?

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:54.320
Step back.

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:04.170
What the...?!

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.330
I see you noticed as well.

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:07.290
Yeah.

00:08:13.380 --> 00:08:15.510
This'll take some doing.

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.930
We'll clear a way for you, Miss...

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.900
...so duck out while we
take care of these guys.

00:08:20.350 --> 00:08:21.180
But I...

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.850
Please do so.

00:08:22.850 --> 00:08:24.560
We may not be able to
protect you here.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.700
What's keeping you?!

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.240
Hurry up and go!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.370
Th-thanks for everything!

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:42.000
Okay, from this point on...

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.910
...we're not about to let
you through, no matter what.

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:52.840
But which direction is the exit?!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:56.340
Is that light from the outside?

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.440
Is that the Devil Gundam?

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:13.020
But what are the chances it would
be right here under our noses?

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:29.580
I-I understand now.

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:31.830
I know why Shinjuku
has been demolished.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:34.460
And I know what
Master's thinking.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.680
Kyoji...!

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:55.030
Move away!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.530
What was that?

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:01.370
Get out.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.280
Get out immediately...

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.830
...and move everyone
away from Shinjuku.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.040
Who are you?

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.080
Hurry!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:11.170
You can get out by
going that way straight up.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.640
- Go!
- Okay!

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.550
You disgusting filth!

00:10:27.230 --> 00:10:31.350
I have to hurry. Otherwise,
it'll go as the Master planned.

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:32.490
I need to tell Domon.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.200
You saw it, didn't you?

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.240
Didn't you?!

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.330
That's all right.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:48.710
Even though you saw it,
it doesn't mean anything.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.830
However, I can't allow
you to leave!

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:57.880
Sai Saici.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.880
Take Rain and go up.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.550
All right, Bro.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.220
We're going this way.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:03.970
But...

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.560
Go, Rain!

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:07.350
I need to ask my master
about something.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:09.780
Okay...

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:11.730
Master!

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:14.520
I now know where the Devil Gundam is!

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.900
It's much too late for that now,
Domon.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.700
It's resurrection time.

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.070
For the Devil Gundam!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.330
What's that?

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:28.190
Yes.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:31.660
The one is about to be resurrected.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:42.090
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:51.350
It's getting even stronger.

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:53.560
Is this also the doing
of that appalling thing?

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:55.060
No.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.820
Thank goodness.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:00.910
We're safe!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.830
And what's the situation
with the others?

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:12.750
Well, it's really terrible...

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:14.460
What's going on?

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.420
Looks like we'll be safe.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:23.380
Yes, but what has become
of Mademoiselle Rain?

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.300
Hey!

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:26.510
Hi!

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.640
Sai Saici has also made it!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.600
Wait.

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:31.470
She's trying to tell us something.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:34.850
Everyone, get away from here!

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.600
The Devil Gundam's under us!

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:40.860
This one's big!

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:46.030
I believe the time
has finally come.

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:47.280
What...?!

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:53.960
It's too late now.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:57.040
Take a good look at our king...

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.130
...and reconsider your future!

00:12:59.130 --> 00:13:02.090
Make the decision to
come forth with me, Domon!

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:09.600
What's that?

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:21.190
That's right!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.480
I now remember!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.490
That monster is what
lured us into a trap!

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:42.710
Like they say, it's darkest at
the lighthouse base.

00:13:43.560 --> 00:13:46.090
But why'd they attack
Shinjuku for so long?

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:47.130
No.

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.890
They weren't attacking the city.

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:50.220
They were protecting it.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:51.050
What?

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.220
Look at it.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:56.640
Like the metamorphosis
of an insect as it grows...

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.810
...the Devil Gundam's been
self-evolving.

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.650
It's in the middle of the process.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.480
Like a larva.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:06.110
Then what was that huge Death Army?

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:08.200
They were like food.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.830
Those robot clones were deployed
before the Devil Gundam arrived.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:15.330
I saw it absorbing them
as it self-evolved.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.250
Are you saying the soldiers
we saw underground...

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.210
...were the people of Shinjuku?

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:20.920
Yes.

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:24.590
It's the most convenient place,
with everything it needs.

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:28.300
But there's one thing the master
didn't consider in his plan.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.180
That Domon would show up!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:34.760
I'll bet you're speechless after
seeing how wonderful this is.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:35.680
That's right.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:39.560
Unlike the others,
I am not controlled by anyone.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.440
I was moved by the sheer
strength of the Devil Gundam...

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:44.770
...and I decided to be a follower.

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.940
You can't be serious.

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:48.530
Now that makes sense!

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:55.490
This is the end for you,
Master Asia!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.460
That's tough talk coming from
a bunch of rookies.

00:15:02.670 --> 00:15:04.040
Shut up!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.750
I don't care if you're the
defending champion or what!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.670
Let's settle this once and for all!

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:10.880
Wait, Chibodee!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.050
Huh? What the...?!

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:19.180
You have no idea
what you're up against!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.560
No!

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:23.310
Now, then!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:25.360
Keep coming at me, you guys!

00:15:25.350 --> 00:15:28.030
I shall! Rose Bits!

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:33.280
I'm attacking, too!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.490
Annoying pests.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:40.160
Here I go now!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:43.960
School of the Undefeated of the East.
Twelve Ohobai!!

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.080
Wha...?!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:48.670
Daishahei!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:53.040
George!

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.140
Master!

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:57.930
Shut up!

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:07.110
Awfully immature for
the King of Hearts.

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:09.320
The Shuffle Alliance
on the other side...

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:10.530
...must be crying tears of regret!

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:19.490
I was stalling for time so that
person could fully revive...

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:22.460
...but I find I'm just
wasting my talents.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:26.830
So, I suppose I'll just
finish you boys off now!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:30.800
I won't allow it!

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:38.060
Return to me!

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:43.690
Master Asia,
Undefeated of the East.

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:45.600
I won't allow you to
have your way.

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.310
What?

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.270
Wh-what is this...?!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:57.200
Gundam Spiegel

00:16:58.370 --> 00:16:59.580
Fine.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.700
Fighting one more at this stage...

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:03.620
...isn't going to make
a difference to me!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:11.340
He's projecting multiple images!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:23.430
He's good...

00:17:23.430 --> 00:17:24.730
Who are you?!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:29.940
I am Schwarz Bruder,
representing Neo Germany.

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:31.480
You'd be wise to remember me.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:38.870
Th-this guy's able to fight
at the same level as Master.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.660
What are you waiting for,
Domon?!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:44.120
You must hurry!
Defeat the Devil Gundam!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.580
Do it!
Before his full body is revealed!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:48.790
Now!

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.210
But, what are you...?!

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.760
That's not important. Hurry!

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.840
He's right, Domon Kasshu.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:58.130
Our priority is to defeat
the Devil Gundam!

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:00.720
You're the only one now
who can fight!

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:03.090
Hurry now! Hurry!

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.930
Th-that's right.

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:08.390
This one.

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:12.360
Because of this guy...
Because of this guy...

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.440
Both Mom...

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:15.940
...and Dad!

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:18.820
All because of this guy!

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:22.370
No! Not that power again!

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:28.500
This hand of mine shines
and roars!

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.830
Its bright cry tells me
to defeat you!

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:32.590
Take this!

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:35.760
My love, my anger, my sorrow!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:39.130
Shining Finger!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:43.550
Go! Go! Go!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.360
You fool!
Why'd you avoid the head?!

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:57.870
What?!

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.360
It's absorbing my energy!

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.160
Beautiful!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.370
Domon's energy will be
enough to resurrect it!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:22.720
That must be...

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:24.690
...the Devil Gundam!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:26.680
A-awesome...

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:34.020
So, this is Kyoji's...

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.080
That guy!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.170
He's in the photo
that Domon was carrying!

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:56.540
My...

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:57.600
...my brother...

00:20:02.010 --> 00:20:03.300
Brother!

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:07.330
Watch out!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:27.400
Domon!

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.950
Take a good look at its body.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.580
Thanks to that power
you provided...

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:37.210
...the Devil Gundam
has fully recovered!

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:39.600
That was quite generous of you.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:46.890
Goodbye, Domon,
King of Hearts!

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:50.240
W-wait!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.640
Wait, don't go yet, Master!

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:54.350
Kyoji!

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:57.230
Kyoji!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:03.070
Kyoji!

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:26.680
We lost.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:29.110
We were totally defeated.

00:21:30.010 --> 00:21:30.970
Can't be helped.

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:35.440
One look at that,
and the outcome was clear.

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:38.520
But, the important thing now...

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:42.480
I know.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:44.890
I can't deny that my own brother...

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.240
...I mean, that Kyoji...

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:51.080
...was serious when
he aimed at me.

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:53.760
I saw that he was totally serious.

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:57.540
Kyoji is no longer...

00:21:58.540 --> 00:21:59.360
Domon...

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:32.370
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:32.740 --> 00:22:36.750
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.210
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:41.670 --> 00:22:44.750
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.050 --> 00:22:51.930
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:52.430 --> 00:22:57.640
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:02.900
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:09.450
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:13.570
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:19.580
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:37.270
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:37.270 --> 00:23:39.640
Domon pursues the Devil Gundam.

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:43.060
And the trap laid by
Master Asia.

00:23:43.060 --> 00:23:46.570
Then, the Gundam Fighter from
Neo Germany...

00:23:46.570 --> 00:23:49.490
...challenges Domon
with a Gundam Fight!

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.530
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.530 --> 00:23:55.780
Challenge! The Mysterious Masked Fighter

00:23:53.990 --> 00:24:00.770
Challenge!
The Mysterious Masked Fighter

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:58.480
Ready! Go!
